                <pb facs="0689" n="545" sameAs="frus:frus1929v02/pg545"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Annex 1]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chinese Legation to the Department of
                    State</hi></head>
                <p>The Italian Treaty with China signed on 27th November, 1928, and annexes are
                    similar to the Belgian with the exception of the following points: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>If no agreement is arrived at regarding the detailed provisions before
                            1 January, 1930, extraterritoriality is to be abolished when all the
                            powers signatory to the Washington Treaty have agreed to its abolition
                            and China has fixed a date therefor;</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>No mention is made regarding the law of personal status.</item>
                    </list></p>
            </div>
        </body>
